7th Day of the Twelfth Lunar Month, North Bank of Hutuo River
Third Quarter of Chen Hour (08:00)
//Seamless scene transition (place the scene directly at the bottom of the Hutuo River, no loading screen needed). This is Wang Qing's inner world. In the center is a table with an open box sitting upon it. In the box is a purple orb of light.
Li Zuo: You've lost the bet, Quxia. Such is the nature of human hearts.
//The camera cuts behind Wang Qing. A purple glow is emanating from the box. The player moves Wang Qing to the table to interact with the box and perform a "pick up item" motion. He is then engulfed by the purple light.
Wang Qing: And yet one heart remains...

To the Young Master:
I've been out for a while. Let me report on my daily life... actually, that's too much trouble. I'll just show you my diary. I'm too lazy to write much, and I have serious business soon.
Day 1: Napped in Perception Forest;
Day 2: Napped in Perception Forest;
Day 3: Napped in Perception Forest;
Day 4: Hai Changchong, oh Hai Changchong, how can you be so degenerate! Have you forgotten the tasks the Young Master assigned you? You can't go on like this!
Day 5: Napped in Perception Forest;
Alright, report finished!
If you need me, you can find me at the Floral Expanse Beyond. If I'm not there, I'm napping.
(The letter seems to have stopped mid-sentence)

The ninth month now reigns, the season of late autumn.
Swollen waters recede, cold pools clear;
Mist gathers, dusk mountains purple.
Steeds prance on high roads,
Seeking scenery on lofty peaks;
Approaching the long isle of imperial heirs,
Finding the old abode of Heaven and Men.
Layered peaks rise emerald, piercing the heavens;
Flying towers glow crimson, overlooking the Earth.
Crane islets and duck shores,
Exhausting winding isles;
Cassia halls and orchid palaces,
Following the mountain's contours.

Brand New Weapon Appearance - Dual Blades 
Bitter sufferings turn into the delight of a meal; 
Fasting past noon, three meals are merged into a feast.
